          })
        ) : (
          <div class="col-span-full text-center py-16 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">現在掲載中のお知らせはありません。</p>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>

      <div class="text-center pt-6">
        <a 
          href="https://note.com" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 hover:border-blue-300 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <span>公式Noteで記事一覧を見る</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE DO (Bento Grid レイアウトへ再構築) -->
  <section class="py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 relative">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-black text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">
        WHAT WE DO
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-tight">
        {currentLang === 'en' ? (
          <>Moving Beyond Our Name:<br /><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-amber-500">Our Challenge for the Future</span></>
        ) : (
          <>名称の由来を超えて<br /><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-amber-500">私たちが目指す未来への挑戦</span></>
        )}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
        {currentLang === 'en' 
          ? "NSF PROJECTs is more than just 'Noto Student Fund.' While our roots stem from disaster relief for the Noto Peninsula Earthquake, we have evolved into a project-driven organization where students nationwide actively tackle various social issues."
          : "NSF PROJECTsは「Noto Student Fund」という名称の時点に留まる組織ではありません。能登半島地震をきっかけに始まった活動をすべての原点としつつ、現在は全国の学生が社会課題に対して主体的に挑戦するプロジェクト型組織へと発展を遂げています。"}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid 配置 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- メイン大型フォトカード (7列) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl min-h-[320px] md:min-h-[400px] border border-slate-200/80 shadow-lg">
        <img 
          src="/unnamed.jpg" 
          alt="被災地支援活動の現場" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700 ease-out" 
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 text-white space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-300 uppercase tracking-widest block">FIELD ACTIVITY</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black">被災地支援の現場から生まれるリアルな挑戦</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- サブフォトカード (5列) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl min-h-[320px] md:min-h-[400px] border border-slate-200/80 shadow-lg">
        <img 
          src="/unnamed (1).jpg" 
          alt="全国から集まる学生メンバー" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700 ease-out" 
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 text-white space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-widest block">NATIONWIDE COMMUNITY</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black">全国から集まる500名超の熱量</h3>
